<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.1">
<l>ceṉṉiyōṅku taṇtiruvēṅ kaṭamuṭai yāyulaku</l>
<l>taṉṉaivāḻa niṉṟanampī tāmota rācatirā</l>
<l>eṉṉaiyumeṉṉu ṭaimaiyaiyumuñ cakarappoṟi yoṟṟikoṇṭu</l>
<l>niṉṉaruḷē purintiruntē ṉiṉiyeṉ tirukkuṟippē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>You of the cool high peaks of Tiruvēṅkaṭam!</l>
<l>Noble who remains so that the world may live!</l>
<l rend="indent">Dāmodara! Fortune!</l>
<l>Having stampled myself and my possessions</l>
<l rend="indent">with the mark of your discus,</l>
<l>I have been longing for your grace.</l>
<l rend="indent">Now what is your holy design?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
